# Agent / tooling working dirs (not part of the project)
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. These directories hold local agent state -- task
# trackers, session notes, tool config -- that is useful on one machine and has
# no business being published. For `.beads/` the scaffolding (config, hooks,
# README) is committed and the tracker data is not: bead text lives in a
# private Dolt remote, never in this repository.
.agents/
.beads/issues.jsonl
.beads/interactions.jsonl
.beads/events.jsonl
.beads/backup/
.beads/dolt/
.beads/embeddeddolt/
.beads/*.db
.beads/.beads-credential-key
.beads/.local_version
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.codex/
.omc/
site/
